<body>
    <h1>Buy Airtime (Kenya, South Sudan, Uganda, Tanzania, Rwanda) *</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 96.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 48.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 48.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 488.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><strong>Use case 7</strong></p></td>
<td colspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><strong>Buy Airtime&nbsp;</stro=
ng></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Actor(s)</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Equity Chatbot System, Customer=
, Equity bank systems</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Use Case Overview</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Customer Wants to buy Airtime U=
sing Equity bank Chatbot</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Preconditions</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer has self-onboarded on Chat bot</p></li>
<li><p>Customer Must have a Valid chatbot Pin</p></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Termination Outcomes</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Condition Affecting Termination Outcomes</p><=
/td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Airtime Top up success</p></li>
</ol></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer chatbot pin is valid</p></li>
<li><p>Customer account has sufficient funds for airtime purchase &amp; cha=
rges</p></li>
<li><p>Airtime purchase is within the limits allowed</p></li>
<li><p>All Systems supporting chatbot are working</p></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p> 2. Airtime Top up&nbsp;&nbsp; =
Failure</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer chatbot pin is Invalid (blocked or wrong)</p></li>
<li><p>Customer bank account has insufficient funds for airtime purchase &a=
mp; charges</p></li>
<li><p>One or more Bank systems supporting chatbot are not working</p></li>
<li><p>Limits is below or above the top up limits</p></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Description of Termination outc=
ome #1</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Buy Airtime</p>
<ol>
<li><p>Customer Opens Equity Bank Chat bot on social media platform of choi=
ce (Whats app, Facebook, telegram, Siri)</p></li>
<li><p>Types a message to requests service of choice</p></li>
</ol><p><em>&lt;</em> <em>if the customer sends a message with a greeting &=
gt;</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;&nbsp; The bot will display a list of services the=
 customer to select from</em></p>
<ol>
<li><p>Balance Inquiry</p></li>
<li><p>Mini Statement</p></li>
<li><p>Full Statement</p></li>
<li><p>Send Money</p></li>
<li><p>Buy Airtime</p></li>
<li><p>Link Additional Account</p></li>
</ol><p><strong>3</strong>. The Customer responds with 5 Buy airtime option=
</p><p><em>&lt;if the customer sends a message asking for a specific servic=
e&gt;</em></p><p><em>The Bot will skip the above step (2) where the custome=
r is prompted to select a service and the bot will respond with prompts for=
 the requested service.</em></p><p><em>Eg Buy airtime&gt;</em></p><p>{Promp=
t</p>
<ol>
<li><p>Select Favorite</p></li>
<li><p>Enter recipient Mobile Number</p></li>
</ol><p>If the customer select favorite after selecting saved favorite they=
 will be prompted to enter amount <strong>(step 7) </strong>and proceed to =
next step, if customer select Enter recipient mobile number the proceed to =
provide recipient mobile number as in <strong>(step 4)</strong></p><p><stro=
ng>4</strong>. Customer select enter recipient mobile number and submit </p=
><p>{Prompt</p><p>Select recipient Telco </p>
<ol>
<li><p>Telco 1</p></li>
<li><p>Telco 2</p></li>
<li><p>Telco 3</p></li>
<li><p>Telco 4}</p></li>
</ol><p><strong>5</strong>. The customer select recipient telco and submit<=
/p><p>{prompt</p><p>enter recipient mobile number. Mobile number format&nbs=
p;&nbsp; 07xx, xxx, xxx, 2547xx, xxx xxx}</p><p><strong>6</strong>. Custome=
r enter recipient mobile number and submit</p><p>{Prompt</p><p>enter airtim=
e amount to purchase}</p><p><strong>7</strong>. Customer enter airtime amou=
nt to purchase and submit</p><p>(Amount can be in digits or in words, and a=
mount will be in transacting account currency)</p><p>{Prompt</p><p>Select t=
he account to transact from</p>
<ol>
<li><p>066 xxxx xxxx xx</p></li>
<li><p>066 xxxx xxxx xx}</p></li>
</ol><p><strong>8</strong>. Customer select the account to transact from &a=
mp; submit</p><p>{Prompt</p><p> Please enter your Chatbot pin</p><p><em> Bu=
y Airtime Ksh (****) for Mobile (****) [Telco] charge (Charge amount).</em>=
</p><p><em> [Enter PIN] [Cancel</em>]}</p><p><strong>9</strong>. Customer i=
s prompted to confirm the transaction details and enter pin on a secure lin=
k</p><p><strong>10</strong>. Customer receives a successful Message notific=
ation&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Confirmed. Purchase =
of (Currency) {amount} of airtime for line ${phone} charge [xxx] on {date} =
at {time}</p><p>Customer account is debited &amp; respective Telco airtime =
Bank GL is credited; the customer is topped up</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp=
;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Transaction Flows</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><strong><u>Airtime top up trans=
action type</u></strong></p>
<ol>
<li><p>Debit Party; Customer, Customer account</p></li>
<li><p>Credit Party; Office GL; Airtime Float GL</p></li>
<li><p>Amount: Amount of Airtime top up</p></li>
</ol><p><strong><u>Airtime top up Charges transaction type: Charges &amp; E=
xcise duty</u></strong></p>
<ol>
<li><p>Debit Party; Customer, Customer account&nbsp;</p></li>
<li><p>Credit Party; Office GL; Commission account</p></li>
<li><p>Amount: As defined through fee configuration -Currently Zero rated</=
p></li>
</ol><p><strong><u>Excise duty (EOD)</u></strong></p>
<ol>
<li><p>Debit Party; Office GL; Commission account,</p></li>
<li><p>Credit Party; Office GL; Excise duty account</p></li>
<li><p>Amount: X % of charges</p></li>
</ol></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Description of termination outc=
ome #2</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>In case of Wrong chatbot pin, i=
nsufficient funds, Limits violations or the systems have an issue chat bot =
system will respond with an appropriate failure response</p><p><strong>Wron=
g PIN Notification</strong></p><p>You have entered the wrong PIN, kindly tr=
y again later&nbsp;</p><p><strong>System Delays</strong>: Your request has =
been received. Processing might take longer than usual, due to system delay=
s being experienced at the moment. Apologies for any Inconveniences.</p><p>=
<strong>System Failure:</strong> Failed. We are not able to complete your r=
equest at the moment. Please try again later.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Use Case Associations</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>The relationship is one to one =
as the customer can only purchase airtime once at a time</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Business Rules Kenya</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"white" colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer chatbot pin must be valid</p></li>
<li><p>Customer account must have sufficient funds for airtime purchase &am=
p; charges</p></li>
<li><p>Buy Airtime minimum transaction limits&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol><p> a)&nbsp;&nbsp;Equitel&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ksh 1</p><p> b)&nbsp;Safar=
icom, Airtel, Telkom&nbsp;&nbsp; Ksh 5</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Must be Configur=
able parameters</p><p> 4. Buy Airtime Maximum transaction limits</p><p> a)&=
nbsp;&nbsp;Equitel&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ksh 8,000</p><p> b)&nbsp;&nbsp;S=
afaricom, Airtel, Telkom&nbsp;&nbsp; Ksh 5,000</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Configur=
able parameters</p><p> 5. Daily Maximum limits</p><p> a)&nbsp;&nbsp;Equitel=
 Ksh 100,000</p><p> b)&nbsp; Safaricom, Airtel, Telkom Ksh 5,000</p><p> =C3=
=98&nbsp; Configurable parameters</p><p> 6. Transaction count</p><p> =C3=98=
&nbsp; Configurable parameter</p><p> 7. System must auto reverse Failed tra=
nsactions</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Business Rules Tanzania</p></td=
>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"white" colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer chatbot pin must be valid</p></li>
<li><p>Customer account must have sufficient funds for send amount &amp; ch=
arges</p></li>
<li><p>Send Money to equity account minimum transaction limits&nbsp;</p></l=
i>
</ol><p> a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ksh 1&nbsp;&nbsp; Normal &amp; Gold cus=
tomer category</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Must be Configurable parameters</p><p> 4=
. Send Money to Equity account Maximum transaction limits</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp=
;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (=
Normal customers category)</p><p> a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ksh 300,000 Pe=
r transaction</p><p> b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ksh 300,000 per day</p><p> Send M=
oney Maximum transaction limits (Gold customers category)</p><p> c)&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ksh 300,000 Per transaction</p><p> d)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ks=
h 1,000,000 per day</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Configurable parameters</p><p> 5. T=
ransaction count</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Configurable parameter</p><p> 6. Syste=
m must auto reverse Failed transactions</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Business Rules Rwanda</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"white" colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ol>
<li><p>Customer chatbot pin must be valid</p></li>
<li><p>Customer account must have sufficient funds for airtime purchase &am=
p; charges</p></li>
<li><p>Buy Airtime minimum transaction limits&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li><p>Airtel&nbsp;&nbsp; RWF 500</p></li>
<li><p>Vodacom,Tigo.500</p></li>
</ul><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Must be Configurable parameters</p><p> 4. Buy Airtime=
 Maximum transaction limits</p><p> a)&nbsp;Airtel&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; R=
WF 100,000</p><p> b)&nbsp;Vodacom, Airtel, Telkom&nbsp;&nbsp; 100,000 &nbsp=
;</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Configurable parameters</p><p> 5. Daily Maximum limit=
s</p><p> a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Airtel RWF 100,000</p><p> b)&nbsp;&nbsp=
;&nbsp; Vodacom, Airtel, Telkom RWF 100,000</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Configurabl=
e parameters</p><p> 6. Transaction count</p><p> =C3=98&nbsp; Configurable p=
arameter</p><p> 7. System must auto reverse Failed transactions</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Inputs Summary</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Telco, Recipient mobile number,=
 Amount, chat bot pin</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Output Summary</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>&nbsp;Success/Failure notificat=
ions.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
